WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.313 --> 00:00:03.142
THANK YOU, JEFF.

00:00:03.176 --> 00:00:05.395
MORE TO COME IN A MOMENT.

00:00:05.397 --> 00:00:07.755
&gt;&gt; WHY ARE WE HAVING THIS

00:00:07.756 --> 00:00:08.991
CRISIS AT THE BORDER?

00:00:09.025 --> 00:00:11.116
WHEN JOE BIDEN GOT ELECTED THE

00:00:11.150 --> 00:00:13.548
FIRST THING HE DID WAS STOP

00:00:13.549 --> 00:00:15.025
CONSTRUCTION OF THE BORDER WALL.

00:00:15.026 --> 00:00:16.697
REINSTITUTED CATCH AND RELEASE

00:00:16.698 --> 00:00:18.914
AND ENDED THE REMAIN IN MEXICO

00:00:18.915 --> 00:00:20.446
POLICY A VERY SUCCESSFUL

00:00:20.447 --> 00:00:21.631
FOREIGN POLICY ACCOMPLISHMENT

00:00:21.633 --> 00:00:23.235
WHERE THE TRUMP ADMINISTRATION

00:00:23.269 --> 00:00:25.300
HAD NEGOTIATED WITH MEXICO THAT

00:00:25.334 --> 00:00:27.361
ILLEGAL IMMIGRANTS FROM CENTRAL

00:00:27.362 --> 00:00:28.862
AMERICA WOULD REMAIN IN MEXICO

00:00:28.863 --> 00:00:30.828
WHILE THEIR ASYLUM PROCEEDINGS

00:00:30.829 --> 00:00:32.376
WERE MOVING FORWARD.

00:00:32.377 --> 00:00:34.482
&gt;&gt; Dana: TED CRUZ ADDRESSING

00:00:34.484 --> 00:00:36.275
THE BORDER CHRISTS LAST HOUR.

00:00:36.310 --> 00:00:39.424
OUR NEXT GUEST SAYS 12 PEOPLE

00:00:39.425 --> 00:00:40.683
ENTERED HIS PROPERTY JUST

00:00:40.718 --> 00:00:41.192
YESTERDAY.

00:00:41.193 --> 00:00:42.437
NINE OF THEM WERE

00:00:42.472 --> 00:00:44.104
CONFRONTATIONAL AND FEARS FOR

00:00:44.138 --> 00:00:46.689
THE SAFETY OF HIS FAMILY.

00:00:46.723 --> 00:00:48.094
THIS RANCHER JOINS US NOW.

00:00:48.128 --> 00:00:49.179
SET IS SCENE.

00:00:49.213 --> 00:00:51.058
WHAT HAS IT BEEN LIKE?

00:00:51.059 --> 00:00:52.707
&gt;&gt; A LOT DIFFERENT THAN I’VE

00:00:52.742 --> 00:00:53.855
EVER SEEN IT.

00:00:53.856 --> 00:00:56.605
I’VE BEEN HERE 25 YEARS AND SO

00:00:56.606 --> 00:00:58.041
I’VE SEEN UNDER MANY

00:00:58.042 --> 00:00:59.016
ADMINISTRATIONS I’VE SEEN LOTS

00:00:59.017 --> 00:00:59.881
OF TROUBLE.

00:00:59.882 --> 00:01:01.898
BUT I’VE NEVER SEEN IT AT THIS

00:01:01.899 --> 00:01:03.663
LEVEL AND I’VE NEVER SEEN IT

00:01:03.664 --> 00:01:06.288
WITH THIS QUALITY OF PEOPLE.

00:01:06.289 --> 00:01:08.220
THERE ARE STILL PEOPLE COMING

00:01:08.254 --> 00:01:10.298
THROUGH THAT REALLY ARE COMING

00:01:10.333 --> 00:01:11.983
TO BETTER THEMSELVES AND BETTER

00:01:11.984 --> 00:01:13.624
THEIR LIVES BUT I THINK THE

00:01:13.625 --> 00:01:14.516
DYNAMICS HAVE CHANGED OF THAT

00:01:14.550 --> 00:01:14.899
TODAY.

00:01:14.934 --> 00:01:16.657
IT IS NOT THE SAME GROUP OF

00:01:16.692 --> 00:01:18.461
FOLKS THAT I’M USED TO SEEING.

00:01:18.462 --> 00:01:19.732
&gt;&gt; Bill: WHAT DO YOU MEAN BY

00:01:19.733 --> 00:01:20.675
THAT, JOHN?

00:01:20.709 --> 00:01:22.495
WHAT’S THE DIFFERENCE?

00:01:22.496 --> 00:01:24.240
&gt;&gt; WELL, THEY ARE MORE

00:01:24.274 --> 00:01:24.691
CONFRONTATIONAL.

00:01:24.693 --> 00:01:27.063
THEY HAVE SOMETHING TO LOSE.

00:01:27.064 --> 00:01:29.274
I DON’T KNOW IF IT’S BECAUSE OF

00:01:29.308 --> 00:01:30.238
HUMAN SMUGGLING.

00:01:30.273 --> 00:01:32.431
MY PROBLEM IS I’M 40 MILES FROM

00:01:32.432 --> 00:01:34.203
THE BORDER SO IT’S NOT LIKE I’M

00:01:34.237 --> 00:01:35.676
SITTING ON THE EDGE OF THE

00:01:35.678 --> 00:01:37.369
BORDER AND ALL THESE PEOPLE ARE

00:01:37.404 --> 00:01:39.502
COMING ACROSS THE RIVER TO ME.

00:01:39.536 --> 00:01:41.512
THE ONLY REASON I CAN ATTRIBUTE

00:01:41.513 --> 00:01:44.509
MY PROBLEMS GETTING BIGGER AND

00:01:44.510 --> 00:01:47.969
BIGGER EVERY DAY IS THE VALUE

00:01:48.003 --> 00:01:49.473
OF HUMAN SMUGGLING.

00:01:49.508 --> 00:01:51.723
WITH THAT SAID, I AM RIGHT

00:01:51.724 --> 00:01:53.517
BEFORE THE CHECKPOINT ON U.S.

00:01:53.519 --> 00:01:54.897
90 SO THE SMUGGLERS ARE

00:01:54.899 --> 00:01:56.880
BRINGING THEM HERE, DROPPING

00:01:56.881 --> 00:01:58.551
THEM OFF AND THEY’RE COMING

00:01:58.553 --> 00:01:59.753
THROUGH MY PROPERTY.

00:01:59.754 --> 00:02:01.897
THAT IN TURN HAS CAUSED LOTS OF

00:02:01.898 --> 00:02:03.078
HEARTACHE FOR US.

00:02:03.079 --> 00:02:04.442
NOT TO MENTION TEARING DOWN OUR

00:02:04.477 --> 00:02:04.821
FENCES.

00:02:04.823 --> 00:02:06.651
COMING TO OUR HOUSES AT NIGHT.

00:02:06.652 --> 00:02:08.487
I HAVE A DAUGHTER.

00:02:08.488 --> 00:02:11.318
I WON’T LET WALK ON THE

00:02:11.352 --> 00:02:13.080
DRIVEWAY, YOU KNOW, TO JOG OR

00:02:13.114 --> 00:02:14.903
EXERCISE BECAUSE OF THIS

00:02:14.904 --> 00:02:17.372
WITHOUT HAVING A DOG WITH HER.

00:02:17.406 --> 00:02:19.640
YOU KNOW, WE’RE KIND OF BEING

00:02:19.675 --> 00:02:21.868
LEFT DOWN HERE AND THE BORDER

00:02:21.902 --> 00:02:24.083
PATROL’S HANDS ARE TIED.

00:02:24.084 --> 00:02:26.312
THEY ARE WORKING TO KEEP

00:02:26.313 --> 00:02:28.035
UNACCOMPANIED MINORS UNDER

00:02:28.036 --> 00:02:29.192
CONTROL IN A FACILITY.

00:02:29.226 --> 00:02:30.646
THEY AREN’T OUT HERE IN THE

00:02:30.680 --> 00:02:32.885
FIELD WHEN I NEED THEM.

00:02:32.886 --> 00:02:34.958
THEY CAN’T COME BECAUSE THEY’RE

00:02:34.992 --> 00:02:36.449
SO STRETCHED OUT.

00:02:36.450 --> 00:02:37.956
THEY GOT -- WE’RE OVERWHELMED.

00:02:37.990 --> 00:02:39.526
WE’VE BEEN THROWN TO THE WOLVES

00:02:39.527 --> 00:02:41.065
HERE AS FAR AS I’M CONCERNED.

00:02:41.066 --> 00:02:42.907
&gt;&gt; Dana: IS THAT ONE OF THE

00:02:42.908 --> 00:02:44.769
REASONS YOU ARE SPEAKING OUT

00:02:44.770 --> 00:02:47.340
TODAY AND COMING ON TELEVISION?

00:02:47.375 --> 00:02:49.161
AS A RANCHER YOU PROBABLY LIKE

00:02:49.195 --> 00:02:50.823
TO KEEP TO YOURSELF, GET YOUR

00:02:50.824 --> 00:02:52.574
WORK DONE AND HAVE A GOOD LIFE

00:02:52.575 --> 00:02:53.744
THERE WITH YOUR FAMILY.

00:02:53.745 --> 00:02:56.173
YOU DECIDED TO COME ON

00:02:56.207 --> 00:02:57.477
TELEVISION TODAY WHY?

00:02:57.511 --> 00:02:59.624
&gt;&gt; WELL, I’VE BEEN WATCHING THE

00:02:59.626 --> 00:03:01.454
MEDIA JUST AS EVERYONE ELSE HAS.

00:03:01.455 --> 00:03:03.705
IT IS PORTRAYING A WAY

00:03:03.740 --> 00:03:05.371
DIFFERENT PICTURE THAN WHAT

00:03:05.405 --> 00:03:06.282
WE’RE HAVING.

00:03:06.317 --> 00:03:07.763
WE’RE SEEING THINGS OF PEOPLE

00:03:07.798 --> 00:03:08.827
TOURING FACILITIES THAT LOOK

00:03:08.861 --> 00:03:10.176
LIKE EVERYTHING IS IN ORDER SO

00:03:10.177 --> 00:03:11.810
ON AND SO FORTH.

00:03:11.811 --> 00:03:13.478
THAT’S NOT THE CASE.

00:03:13.479 --> 00:03:15.246
IF THTHEY REALLY WANT TO SEE

00:03:15.248 --> 00:03:16.770
WHAT’S GOING ON AND WHAT THEY

00:03:16.771 --> 00:03:18.836
DON’T WANT TO SEE, THEN THEY

00:03:18.870 --> 00:03:20.302
NEED TO COME VISIT PEOPLE LIKE

00:03:20.337 --> 00:03:22.615
ME THAT HAVE TO BATTLE THIS

00:03:22.650 --> 00:03:24.666
EVERY DAY IN THEIR OWN BACKYARD.

00:03:24.667 --> 00:03:26.291
THE THING THAT EVERYBODY NEEDS

00:03:26.293 --> 00:03:27.249
TO UNDERSTAND, THESE PEOPLE

00:03:27.251 --> 00:03:28.447
AREN’T STAYING HERE.

00:03:28.448 --> 00:03:30.157
THEY ARE COMING TO YOUR TOWN.

00:03:30.158 --> 00:03:31.538
WHETHER THEY ARE GOOD OR BAD

00:03:31.539 --> 00:03:33.212
THEY’RE COMING TO YOUR TOWN.

00:03:33.213 --> 00:03:34.439
WE HAVE TOO MUCH BORDER PATROL

00:03:34.474 --> 00:03:35.097
PRESENCE HERE.

00:03:35.131 --> 00:03:36.981
THEY DON’T WANT TO BE HERE.

00:03:36.982 --> 00:03:38.886
THEY CAN’T LEGALLY BE HERE.

00:03:38.920 --> 00:03:40.622
WE CAN’T LEGALLY WORK THEM.

00:03:40.656 --> 00:03:42.168
SO WITHOUT A GUEST WORKER

00:03:42.169 --> 00:03:43.940
PROGRAM THAT WORKS, WHERE ARE

00:03:43.941 --> 00:03:45.527
WE GOING WITH THIS, GUYS?

00:03:45.562 --> 00:03:46.954
&gt;&gt; Bill: WHAT IS YOUR LEVEL OF

00:03:46.956 --> 00:03:48.198
CONFIDENCE NOW THAT KAMALA

00:03:48.233 --> 00:03:51.033
HARRIS HAS BEEN PUT IN CHARGE

00:03:51.034 --> 00:03:52.265
OF THIS NATIONAL CRISIS?

00:03:52.266 --> 00:03:53.815
&gt;&gt; I HAVE VERY LITTLE

00:03:53.817 --> 00:03:55.097
CONFIDENCE IN ANYTHING THAT

00:03:55.098 --> 00:03:56.785
WE’RE DOING RIGHT NOW.

00:03:56.786 --> 00:03:58.756
AT LEAST IN THE PRIOR

00:03:58.757 --> 00:04:00.373
ADMINISTRATION WE HAD A PLAN.

00:04:00.374 --> 00:04:02.202
WE HAD SOMETHING IN PLACE THAT

00:04:02.236 --> 00:04:03.688
WAS AT LEAST CONTROLLING THE

00:04:03.689 --> 00:04:05.471
ISSUE AND THEY KNEW WHAT WAS

00:04:05.506 --> 00:04:07.203
GOING TO HAPPEN TO THE

00:04:07.205 --> 00:04:08.163
INDIVIDUAL ONCE THEY WERE

00:04:08.164 --> 00:04:08.598
APPREHENDED.

00:04:08.599 --> 00:04:10.423
NOW WE HAVE NO PLAN.

00:04:10.424 --> 00:04:11.933
WE HAVE NO DIRECTION.

00:04:11.934 --> 00:04:13.062
WHERE ARE WE GOING?

00:04:13.096 --> 00:04:14.030
I DON’T THINK ANYBODY KNOWS

00:04:14.064 --> 00:04:14.864
THAT ANSWER.

00:04:14.899 --> 00:04:16.021
DO YOU GUYS?

00:04:16.022 --> 00:04:17.958
&gt;&gt; Dana: NO, SIR.

00:04:17.993 --> 00:04:19.305
&gt;&gt; Bill: NOT TODAY.

00:04:19.306 --> 00:04:20.531
&gt;&gt; Dana: JOHN, TREMENDOUS

00:04:20.532 --> 00:04:21.792
AMOUNT OF RESPECT FOR YOU.

00:04:21.826 --> 00:04:23.087
WE WOULD LOVE TO KEEP IN TOUCH

00:04:23.122 --> 00:04:24.801
WITH YOU, PLEASE.

00:04:24.802 --> 00:04:26.385
&gt;&gt; Bill: YOU MAKE SOME

00:04:26.387 --> 00:04:27.238
EXCELLENT POINTS.

00:04:27.239 --> 00:04:28.833
THANKS FOR SHARING THEM WITH

00:04:28.834 --> 00:04:30.088
OUR AUDIENCE AND PERHAPS

00:04:30.089 --> 00:04:31.439
POLITICAL LEADERS IN CHARGE AS

00:04:31.440 --> 00:04:31.540
WELL.

